.secrets
# Data/ holds multi-GB local inputs; its README and the NeST graph files are tracked.
Data/*
!Data/README.md
!Data/red_ontology.txt
!Data/red_gene2ind.txt
.git-credentials
nohup.out
.nfs*

# Architecture performance experiment outputs (multi-TB on disk; not suitable for Git/Git LFS).
# The rest of `ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/` (code, configs, READMEs) is tracked.
ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/**/results/
ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/**/long_results/
ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/**/logs/
ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/**/shared/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-job logs: every bundled job line ends `> D{drug}_{exp}.log`, writing into the
# method directory it was launched from.
*.log

# Job lists under ArchitecturePerformanceExperiments/*/jobs/ are tracked (relative paths to <repo>/Data).

/scripts/
